notes = "GlyphOfWardingEffect is the caster lifetime/child-removal bookkeeping owner of the real spatial_effect.spell.glyph_of_warding. It adds no caster body rune. The actual created spatial origin owns the finite hand trace and exact attributed elemental contacts. The canonical GroundSurface owns a neutral retained shell for that exact disclosed UUID. Richer armed/hostile-trigger/payload/Sleep/Detonation studies are optional unselected alternatives, not mandatory backend fields. This caster ledger adds no duplicate shell and removal alone proves no hostile trigger."
